{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Sally's On-The-Job Training", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "A Steep Learning Curve", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 17, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Simple Past Tense versus Past Continuous Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Simple Past tense to talk about events that are finished. You use the Past Continuous to talk about an event or action that was happening at a time in the past.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Simple Past tense verbs can be regular or irregular.<br> Regular verbs end in <span class=\"italic\">-ed</span> or <span class=\"italic\">\u2013ied</span>.<br/> Irregular verbs change in different ways. (e.g. <span class=\"italic\">have &#8594; had, eat &#8594; ate</span>)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For the Past Continuous tense, you write <span class=\"italic\">was/were</span> + verb + <span class=\"italic\">ing</span>.<br/> Some verbs need a change to the last letter before you add <span class=\"italic\">-ing.</span> (e.g. <span class=\"italic\">run &#8594; running</span>, <span class=\"italic\">make &#8594; making</span>)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Present \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" talk \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"talked \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were talking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" get \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"got \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were getting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" fly \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"flew\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were flying\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" work \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"worked \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were working\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" discuss \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"discussed \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were discussing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"enjoy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"enjoyed\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were enjoying\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I <span class=\"strong\">was thinking</span> about doing an article on types of ice cream. (<span class=\"strong\">Past Continuous</span>)", "type": "example"}, {"content": "My editor <span class=\"strong\">told</span> me that wasn't a good idea. (<span class=\"strong\">Simple Past</span>)", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I <span class=\"strong\">was considering</span> a story about people's favorite ice cream. (<span class=\"strong\">Past Continuous</span>)", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Then I <span class=\"strong\">remembered</span> they asked me to write about different jobs.(<span class=\"strong\">Simple Past</span>)", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "nerve-wracking", "type": "name"}, {"content": "difficult; stressful ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My first day on the job was a bit nerve-wracking.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about work.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "learning curve", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the amount you need to learn, described like a graph", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll have a steep learning curve, that's for sure.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "editor ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the person responsible for deciding on the content of publications like newspapers or magazines", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: My editor told me it wasn't a good idea.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "lawyer ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who defends people in the legal system, or tries to prove they are guilty of a crime", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: Working as a lawyer is difficult.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "dentist", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who cares for teeth", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It takes many years of education to become a dentist.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "secretary ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who assists with a variety of office tasks ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Secretaries are very important in an organization.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "physician ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "medical doctor", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: Our city needs more physicians.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Ask 5 people what happened to them on the first day of a new job. Try to find stories that are interesting or funny.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask questions to get more details.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask each person how they felt about the experience.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write the answers on a list.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Present the most interesting story to your classmates.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk to 5 people.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a list of stories.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I present 1 story to the class.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn5le17ob02re2img06.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le17ob02re2img06.jpg", "time": "10", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, my first day was a bit nerve-wracking. I'll have a steep learning curve, that's for sure.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  What do you mean?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, everything was going well until I started talking about my new story ideas.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm sure you have lots of great story ideas."}, {"image": "engenn5le17ob02re2img02.jpg", "time": "15500", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  I was thinking about doing an article on types of ice cream at the new ice cream parlour, but my editor told me that wasn't a good idea.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Why not?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: She said we can't promote one particular business.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I can understand that."}, {"image": "engenn5le17ob02re2img07.jpg", "time": "29250", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Then I was considering a story about people's favorite ice cream, but then I remembered they asked me to write about different jobs.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Why don't you do a survey about people's favorite ice cream, and make a connection to their jobs? For example, you could find out what the favorite ice cream of lawyers, dentists, physicians or secretaries is.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hmmm \u2026 I'll think about it."}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le17ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le17ob02re2img06.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [], "audiosrc": "engenn5le17ob02re6aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le17ob02re6img01.jpg"}, "type": "picture"}], "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about jobs and work. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk or report about actions, events or people. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "   I can say what I was doing when something else happened.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How do you feel on the first day of a new job? Excited? Nervous?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "  Do you find it nerve-wracking?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header